note The Results tab: a hint when there is nothing to show; an orange caption when the hits were cut at HIT_LIMIT; else the hits grouped under a row per file with its hit count (clicking it opens the file), each hit its right-aligned line number and the trimmed line (a click pushes GoTo). Only the rows in view are built.

